    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Reconstructed request collection from the implemented API and conversation. No saved responses or claimed execution results. Existing users make signup return 409; log in instead. Login requests automatically store tokens; create requests store new employee IDs. Run ownership checks before deletion. Rate-limit request is manual: repeat until 429. expired_token must be supplied for that optional test. base_url defaults to the hosted API; change to http://localhost:3000 for local testing."
  },
